 any correct answer is acceptable. For example, if  \"bcbc\", we can either remove 'b' at index  or 'c' at index .  Input Format  The first line contains an integer, , denoting the number of test cases.  Each line  of the  subsequent lines (where ) describes a test case in the form of a single string, .  Constraints  All characters are lowercase English letters. Output Format  Print an integer denoting the zero-indexed position of the character that makes  not a palindrome; if  is already a palindrome or no such character exists, print .  Sample Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":229589,"global_rank":113852},{"name":"ashtable/153effect-ashtable-backend","owner":"ashtable","html_url":"https://github.com/ashtable/153effect-ashtable-backend","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229583,"global_rank":113867},{"name":"alok-upadhyay/python-nmap","owner":"alok-upadhyay","html_url":"https://github.com/alok-upadhyay/python-nmap","stars":1,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"A simple script to scan the open ports on a supplied port","topics":[],"score":229579,"global_rank":113871},{"name":"arokem/xvfbmagic","owner":"arokem","html_url":"https://github.com/arokem/xvfbmagic","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Run code in IPython wrapped in xvfbwrapper","topics":[],"score":229576,"global_rank":113875},{"name":"bcov77/pipeline_for_diversify","owner":"bcov77","html_url":"https://github